  "source_task": "Count the number of labeled directed acyclic graphs (DAGs) with $n$ vertices, where the graph is weakly connected (replacing all directed edges with undirected edges results in a connected graph). Output the result modulo $998244353$.\n\n## Input Format\n\nA single integer $T$.\n\n## Output Format\n\nOutput $T$ lines. The $i$-th line ($1 \\le i \\le T$) should contain the answer for $n = i$.\n\n## Sample Input and Output\n\n### Input Sample #1\n\n```\n5\n```\n\n### Output Sample #1\n\n```\n1\n2\n18\n446\n26430\n```\n\n## Notes\n\nThe first point has $T = 2000$.\n\nThe second point has $T = 100000$.\n\nThe input will be given via stdin and the output should be printed to stdout by your code.\n\nNow solve the problem by providing the code.\n"
